---
title: "WarningHistory"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: ordinary statement
  s1: warning added
  s2: shown once
  s3: shown twice
  s4: next statement
  s5: failure retained
  s6: reset
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Statement records warning
  s1 --> s2: Read retained warnings
  s2 --> s3: Read warnings again
  s3 --> s4: Begin ordinary statement#59; clear warnings
  s4 --> s5: Statement fails#59; replace diagnostics
  s5 --> s6: Reset connection
